+/*
+ * Map Network Drive and Disconnect Network Drives (Stained Glass OS)
+ *
+ * WNetConnectionDialog1W and WNetDisconnectDialog1W were stubs: File
+ * Explorer could not map a drive (David). The dialogs Windows shows: a drive
+ * letter and a folder (\\server\share), reconnect at sign-in, other
+ * credentials; and the list of mapped drives to disconnect. The connection
+ * itself is WNetAddConnection2W -- the network provider's.
